{
  "name": "@memberjunction/ng-rich-text-editor",
  "version": "5.49.0",
  "description": "MemberJunction: DOM-native WYSIWYG rich text editor. The contenteditable DOM is the document — no internal model, no schema, no re-normalization sweeps — so untouched HTML (Outlook/Gmail reply chains, tables, conditional comments) survives load→edit→serialize. Ships an Angular-free engine plus an Angular component with ControlValueAccessor.",
